Package: git-version-planner
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: tech-zerolei <tech-zerolei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), git (>= 1:2.48.0), bubblewrap (>= 0.8.0), zenity, xdg-utils
Recommends: x-www-browser
Homepage: https://github.com/tech-zerolei/git-automatic-management
Description: Offline read-only Git version planner with a Chinese desktop UI
 Inspect a selected local Git worktree, confirm a SemVer baseline, review
 Conventional Commits version suggestions, and export Markdown or JSON.
 Does not commit, tag, push, connect to GitHub or transmit data to a model.
 Requires a graphical desktop, a browser and working Bubblewrap namespaces.
